---
description: Swift and SwiftUI conventions
globs: ["**/*.swift"]
---
- Use SwiftUI and MVVM.
- No UIKit without approval.
- No third-party dependencies without approval.
- Prefer async/await over callbacks.
- Keep views small and readable.
- Put business logic in view models or services, not directly in views.
- Do not add clever abstractions just to look architectural.
- Preserve existing behavior.
- Accessibility required.
- Prefer simple solutions.
